 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an isolated in-memory rental inventory. Add boards or sails with a
+daily price in integer euro cents, then quote or book a period using UTC ISO-8601 timestamps at
+midnight. The end timestamp is exclusive, so a rental from one midnight to the next is one day.
+Bookings for the same item cannot overlap. Cancellation and refunds are not available yet.
+
+```ts
+import { createRentalService } from './index.js';
+
+const rentals = createRentalService();
+rentals.addEquipment({ id: 'board-1', kind: 'board', dailyPrice: 2500 });
+const quote = rentals.quote({
+  itemId: 'board-1',
+  start: '2026-07-01T00:00:00Z',
+  end: '2026-07-03T00:00:00Z',
+});
+```
