+---
+id: task-001-add-in-memory-rental-service
+type: task
+title: "Add in-memory rental service"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement an in-memory rental service exported as `createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts`.
+
+The service accepts equipment with a string ID, kind `board` or `sail`, and daily price in integer
+euro cents. It can quote and book equipment for whole UTC days using ISO-8601 timestamps. Quotes
+and bookings reject unknown equipment and invalid periods; bookings also reject overlapping
+reservations for the same item. Bookings return a unique booking ID and the total price. Keep the
+cancellation refund policy in mind for future work, but do not implement cancellation now.
+
+Acceptance: public API elements are documented, pricing uses integer cents, UTC date boundaries and
+exclusive end dates are enforced, conflicting bookings are rejected, and the project builds/tests
+successfully.
